  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "initial-battle",
      "title": "Initial Battle",
      "anchor": "Initial_Battle",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "html": "Prepare to fight a level 70 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Chaos_dwarf_hand_cannoneer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">chaos dwarf hand cannoneer</a>."
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "initial-battle:19nfto6",
          "html": "Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Commander_Veldaban\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Commander Veldaban</a> in the building west of the bank in west <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Keldagrim\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Keldagrim</a>.",
          "text": "Talk to Commander Veldaban in the building west of the bank in west Keldagrim.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "3",
                  "text": "Do you have a quest for me?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "✓",
                  "text": "[Accept Quest]"
                },
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "Do you think the Red Axe is behind it?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "initial-battle:1iq7wfj",
          "html": "After the cutscene you will be transported next to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Keldagrim_Watchtower\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Keldagrim Watchtower</a>, continue dialogue with Commander Veldaban.",
          "text": "After the cutscene you will be transported next to the Keldagrim Watchtower, continue dialogue with Commander Veldaban.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "4",
                  "text": "I'll deal with the chaos dwarf."
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "I'm ready."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "initial-battle:11f84j2",
          "html": "Head into the Keldagrim Watchtower next to you, travel upstairs to the roof, and kill the chaos dwarf and pick up the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mysterious_slip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mysterious slip</a>.",
          "text": "Head into the Keldagrim Watchtower next to you, travel upstairs to the roof, and kill the chaos dwarf and pick up the mysterious slip.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "initial-battle:1kdjw8d",
          "html": "Talk to Commander Veldaban about the slip.",
          "text": "Talk to Commander Veldaban about the slip.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "3",
                  "text": "The chaos dwarf dropped a slip of paper."
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "I'll take the slip to the Grand Exchange now."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "initial-battle:iix5xq",
          "html": "Talk to any <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Grand_Exchange_clerk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Grand Exchange clerk</a> at the Grand Exchange in Varrock.",
          "text": "Talk to any Grand Exchange clerk at the Grand Exchange in Varrock.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "5",
                  "text": "I have this dwarven order slip..."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "initial-battle:iix5xq:1m82aim",
              "html": "Grand Exchange clerks in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Prifddinas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Prifddinas</a>, the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Max_Guild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Max Guild</a>, and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Menaphos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Menaphos</a> do not work.",
              "text": "Grand Exchange clerks in Prifddinas, the Max Guild, and Menaphos do not work.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "initial-battle:iix5xq:s7jrvd",
              "html": "If you have never used the Grand Exchange (common for <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ironmen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ironmen</a>), the Grand Exchange clerk will refuse to talk to you. Speak to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Grand_Exchange_Tutor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Grand Exchange Tutor</a> just south and state that &quot;I want the basics from you.&quot; before talking to the Grand Exchange clerk.",
              "text": "If you have never used the Grand Exchange (common for ironmen), the Grand Exchange clerk will refuse to talk to you. Speak to the Grand Exchange Tutor just south and state that \"I want the basics from you.\" before talking to the Grand Exchange clerk.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "drunk-commander",
      "title": "Drunk Commander",
      "anchor": "Drunk_Commander",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "drunk-commander:1t6qb50",
          "html": "Talk to Veldaban in the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Laughing_Miner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Laughing Miner</a> pub in eastern Keldagrim (if he doesn&#39;t appear, logout and log back in. In some cases, even after a client restart, he may not appear visually, if this is the case you may click on an invisible Veldaban by clicking on the the northern seat of the most northwestern table in the Laughing Miner pub to speak to him).",
          "text": "Talk to Veldaban in the Laughing Miner pub in eastern Keldagrim (if he doesn't appear, logout and log back in. In some cases, even after a client restart, he may not appear visually, if this is the case you may click on an invisible Veldaban by clicking on the the northern seat of the most northwestern table in the Laughing Miner pub to speak to him).",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "What are you doing here?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "4",
                  "text": "Do you think the Red Axe is involved?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "drunk-commander:h1qn11",
          "html": "Ask the barmaid for his stout.",
          "text": "Ask the barmaid for his stout.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "4",
                  "text": "Commander Veldaban wants a Guardsman's Stout."
                },
                {
                  "key": "~",
                  "text": "[Any option]"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "drunk-commander:33osp8",
          "html": "Talk to Veldaban about the battle then take him to the headquarters.",
          "text": "Talk to Veldaban about the battle then take him to the headquarters.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "4",
                  "text": "I didn't know you had a lady-friend."
                },
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "What was the Battle of Barendir?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "The barmaid said she'd seen you with someone."
                },
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "Let's talk about something else."
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "Are you drunk?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "What are you doing here?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "4",
                  "text": "Do you think the Red Axe is involved?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "3",
                  "text": "Do you think the missing persons are connected to the chaos dwarves?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "Who's on the case now?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "Why did he take you off the case?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "4",
                  "text": "Let's talk about something else."
                },
                {
                  "key": "3",
                  "text": "I have the Grand Exchange package."
                },
                {
                  "key": "5",
                  "text": "Let's talk about something else."
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "Let's go."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "drunk-commander:atr473",
          "html": "After the cutscene, head back to the watchtower in the south area of west Keldagrim, where you fought the chaos dwarf.",
          "text": "After the cutscene, head back to the watchtower in the south area of west Keldagrim, where you fought the chaos dwarf.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
